    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Arawai is neutral good and her domain is fertility, plant life, and abundance.</p>\n\n\n<p><strong>Areas of Concern</strong> Fertility, crops, abundance, plants, the wilderness, birth<br /><strong>Alignment</strong> NG<br /><strong>Divine Font</strong> Heal<br /><strong>Divine Ability</strong> Wisdom or Constitution<br /><strong>Divine Skill</strong> Nature<br /><strong>Domains</strong> Earth, family, healing, nature, stars, sun, passion, toil, water<br /><strong style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">Cleric Spells</strong><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> 1st: temporary tool, 2nd: shape wood, 3rd: wall of thorns.<br /></span><strong style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">Edicts</strong><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> Encourage hard work that benefits all, ensure the health of crops and vegetation, protect forests and farmland from ravagers.<br /></span><strong style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">Anathema</strong><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> Destroy healthy crops, waste food, refuse to help others in your community.<br /></span><strong style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">Favoured Weapon</strong><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> Flail</span></p>\n"
    },
